                    747.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. No Employee shall be precluded, regardless of whether or not he or she is a member of the Union, from bringing matters of personal concern to the attention of appropriate officials under applicable law, rule, regulation, or published policy; or from choosing his or her own representative for an appellate or grievance action based on law, regulation, or this agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
